  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**According to the question, after interchanging the given two signs ' and –' :**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 18 ÷ 3 + 8 × 5 – 4 = 30\n\n**18 ÷ 3**__ - 8 × 5 + 4 = 30\n\n6 - __**8 × 5**__ + 4 = 30\n\n__**6 + 4**__ - 40 = 30\n\n__**10 - 40**__ = 30\n\n-30 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 4 × 6 + 7 – 3 ÷ 1 = 20\n\n4 × 6 - 7 + **3 ÷ 1**__ = 20\n\n__**4 × 6**__ - 7 + 3 = 20\n\n__**24 + 3**__ - 7 = 20\n\n__**27 - 7**__ = 20\n\n20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 18 + 8 × 6 ÷ 3 – 11 = 13\n\n18 - 8 × **6 ÷ 3**__ + 11 = 13\n\n18 - __**8 × 2**__ + 11 = 13\n\n__**18 + 11**__ - 16 = 13\n\n__**29 - 16**__ = 13\n\n13 = 13 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 6 × 9 + 7 – 8 ÷ 2 = 51\n\n6 × 9 - 7 + **8 ÷ 2**__ = 51\n\n__**6 × 9**__ - 7 + 4 = 51\n\n__**54 + 4**__ - 7 = 51\n\n__**58 - 7**__ = 51\n\n51 = 51 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
